msgid "Market Split problem {#market-split-problem}"
msgstr "Problema Market Split {#market-split-problem}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Table 1 shows specific performance metrics for the Parity Twine Optimizer applied to various instances of the Market Split (MS) problem.\n"
"These were obtained from the [QOBLIB - Quantum Optimization Benchmarking Library](https://github.com/ZIB-AOPT/QOBLIB) and correspond to\n"
"[submissions](https://github.com/ZIB-AOPT/QOBLIB/tree/main/01-marketsplit/submissions/20260728_Parity_Twine_Optimizer) made to the\n"
"library using the Parity Twine Optimizer.\n"
msgstr ""
"La Tabla 1 muestra métricas de rendimiento específicas para el Parity Twine Optimizer aplicado a varias instancias del problema Market Split (MS).\n"
"Estas se obtuvieron de la [QOBLIB - Quantum Optimization Benchmarking Library](https://github.com/ZIB-AOPT/QOBLIB) y corresponden a\n"
"[envíos](https://github.com/ZIB-AOPT/QOBLIB/tree/main/01-marketsplit/submissions/20260728_Parity_Twine_Optimizer) realizados a la\n"
"biblioteca utilizando el Parity Twine Optimizer.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"MS violation is an accuracy metric that measures how far the solution is from satisfying all constraints, defined as $\\sum_i ((Ax - b)_i)^2$. Lower values of this metric indicate more accurate solutions.\n"
"Table 1 reports averaged values for five runs of each instance using the Parity Twine Optimizer with the `ibm_boston` device as a backend and 100,000 shots.\n"
"The minimum MS violation obtained from the runs of each instance is reported.\n"
msgstr ""
"MS violation es una métrica de precisión que mide qué tan lejos está la solución de satisfacer todas las restricciones, definida como $\\sum_i ((Ax - b)_i)^2$. Valores más bajos de esta métrica indican soluciones más precisas.\n"
"La Tabla 1 reporta los valores promediados de cinco ejecuciones de cada instancia utilizando el Parity Twine Optimizer con el dispositivo `ibm_boston` como backend y 100 000 shots.\n"
"Se reporta la MS violation mínima obtenida de las ejecuciones de cada instancia.\n"

